Description: AI-assisted DNS reconnaissance and attack-surface mapping
 Fierce-NG is a modern replacement for the classic fierce DNS reconnaissance
 tool. It blends passive OSINT (Certificate Transparency, Shodan) with active
 DNS enumeration under an explicit stealth budget, uses a lightweight character
 n-gram model to predict likely subdomains beyond static wordlists, builds a
 property graph of the attack surface, and assigns each finding a 0-100 risk
 score. Every run emits a signed, reproducible manifest.
 .
 Intended for authorized security testing and research only.
